<title>USA: Corning sees strong 1997.</title>
<headline>Corning sees strong 1997.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corning Inc said Tuesday it expects 1997 to be a strong year, though the growth rate cannot be expected to match that of the first quarter.</p>
<p>Also on Tuesday the company reported first quarter earnings of $0.40 per share compared to $0.27 per share in last year's period.</p>
<p>The company said it is well positioned for extraordinary growth in its communications-related businesses.</p>
</text>
